# Build artifacts. This is a scratch repo, so nothing here is graded and
# nothing here is precious, but a git status full of binaries makes it
# hard to see the file you actually care about.

*.o
*.d
*.a
*.i
*.s
*.out
a.out
*.exe

# The suffixed builds the Makefile knows how to produce.
*-asan
*-O0
*-O1
*-O2

# Generated by `make bigfile` and `make fixtures`.
big.txt
fixtures/

# Debug symbol bundles (macOS)
*.dSYM/

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Sanitizer and coverage output
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov

# A plain binary has no extension, so `make readings` leaves an untracked
# file called `readings` that git cannot tell from a text file you meant
# to keep. Nothing here can guess which is which. Add the name below if
# it bothers you, or ignore it: this repo is scratch and nobody grades
# your commit history in it.
